   "rows": [
    {
     "n": "1",
     "on": "is",
     "of": "doc",
     "text": "On the PC, IRQ2 is LPT2's line; on EGA and VGA boards it is the vertical retrace interrupt, which many VGA boards do not implement.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "rbil61:INTERRUP.A",
       "lines": "767",
       "sha": "a0d6a6390345850a733cf5cb16671166e3029e3aeb7e127c7bda815417d9e2da"
      },
      {
       "ref": "rbil61:INTERRUP.A",
       "lines": "778-780",
       "sha": "fff44a0fef6280863b1ab15d333908ce70a6c30716067ec704c68fc332b2ca32"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "2",
     "on": "is",
     "of": "doc",
     "text": "On ATs and above the physical line for IRQ2 is labeled IRQ9 and connects to the slave 8259; the BIOS redirects the interrupt back here.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "rbil61:INTERRUP.A",
       "lines": "772-774",
       "sha": "36100810fd5cbde6d6df776d2dd596ffda69a9ec50f55570cf6bb1d7b5576cff"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "3",
     "on": "place",
     "of": "dosbox-x",
     "vs": "place",
     "text": "DOSBox-X starts the slave controller's interrupt on the master's cascade line.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "dosbox-x:src/hardware/pic.cpp",
       "lines": "535-537",
       "sha": "3f135d1554a87da2f82acabfaf371fdd8d7823df38e413fd8614391a386d160d"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "4",
     "on": "place",
     "of": "dosbox-x",
     "vs": "place",
     "text": "On the PC that cascade line is IRQ 2.",
     "quotes": [
      {
